<rml>
<head>
    <title>Cowbraten Settings</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="../styles/base.rcss" />
    <link type="text/rcss" href="../styles/controls.rcss" />
    <link type="text/rcss" href="../styles/settings.rcss" />
</head>

<body data-model="settings">
    <div class="settings-screen">
        <div class="settings-shell panel">
            <div class="settings-header">
                <div class="settings-lockup">
                    <div class="settings-mark">C</div>
                    <div class="settings-heading">
                        <div class="settings-product">Cowbraten</div>
                        <div class="settings-title">Settings</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <button class="button settings-back" onclick="navigation.main">
                    Back&nbsp;&nbsp;/&nbsp;&nbsp;Main Menu
                </button>
            </div>

            <div class="settings-content">
                <div class="settings-navigation">
                    <div class="settings-navigation-label">Categories</div>
                    <div class="nav-list settings-nav-list">
                        <button class="nav-item settings-nav-item"
                            data-class-is-selected="category_game"
                            onclick="settings.category.game">
                            <span class="settings-nav-index">01</span>
                            <span>Game</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="nav-item settings-nav-item"
                            data-class-is-selected="category_hud"
                            onclick="settings.category.hud">
                            <span class="settings-nav-index">02</span>
                            <span>HUD</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="nav-item settings-nav-item"
                            data-class-is-selected="category_graphics"
                            onclick="settings.category.graphics">
                            <span class="settings-nav-index">03</span>
                            <span>Graphics</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="nav-item settings-nav-item"
                            data-class-is-selected="category_audio"
                            onclick="settings.category.audio">
                            <span class="settings-nav-index">04</span>
                            <span>Audio</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="nav-item settings-nav-item"
                            data-class-is-selected="category_mouse_keyboard"
                            onclick="settings.category.mouse-keyboard">
                            <span class="settings-nav-index">05</span>
                            <span>Mouse / Keyboard</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="nav-item settings-nav-item"
                            data-class-is-selected="category_crosshair"
                            onclick="settings.category.crosshair">
                            <span class="settings-nav-index">06</span>
                            <span>Crosshair</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="nav-item settings-nav-item"
                            data-class-is-selected="category_chat"
                            onclick="settings.category.chat">
                            <span class="settings-nav-index">07</span>
                            <span>Chat</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="nav-item settings-nav-item" disabled="true">
                            <span class="settings-nav-index">08</span>
                            <span>Advanced / Network</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <div class="settings-scope-note" data-if="category_game">
                        <div class="settings-scope-kicker">Live Setting</div>
                        <div class="settings-scope-copy">
                            Field of view is connected directly to the existing Sauer configuration system.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="settings-scope-note" data-if="category_graphics">
                        <div class="settings-scope-kicker">Typed Runtime State</div>
                        <div class="settings-scope-copy">
                            Display mode and VSync report accepted SDL state. Frame limiting uses Cowbraten's existing render scheduler.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="settings-scope-note" data-if="category_hud">
                        <div class="settings-scope-kicker">Combat Information</div>
                        <div class="settings-scope-copy">
                            Damage feedback and frag messages use the existing HUD paths. Cowbraten streak milestones share the frag-message presentation.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="settings-scope-note" data-if="category_audio">
                        <div class="settings-scope-kicker">Existing Sound Mix</div>
                        <div class="settings-scope-copy">
                            Sauer provides separate sound and music levels. Sound Volume at zero also mutes music through the existing engine gate.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="settings-scope-note" data-if="category_mouse_keyboard">
                        <div class="settings-scope-kicker">Gameplay Mouse</div>
                        <div class="settings-scope-copy">
                            These controls affect relative gameplay look. RmlUi continues to use the operating system's absolute pointer while menus are open.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="settings-scope-note" data-if="category_crosshair">
                        <div class="settings-scope-kicker">Gameplay Reticle</div>
                        <div class="settings-scope-copy">
                            Selection loads Sauer's existing normal and hit textures. Dynamic effects remain controlled by the gameplay renderer.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="settings-scope-note" data-if="category_chat">
                        <div class="settings-scope-kicker">Message Routing</div>
                        <div class="settings-scope-copy">
                            Public and team chat remain in Sauer's console buffer. These controls choose which live feeds present each message type.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="settings-stage">
                    <div class="settings-page" data-if="category_game">
                        <div class="settings-stage-header">
                            <div class="eyebrow settings-eyebrow">Game / Camera</div>
                            <div class="settings-stage-title">View</div>
                            <div class="settings-stage-copy">
                                Tune the horizontal field of view. Changes apply immediately and use Cowbraten's existing persistent setting.
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section panel">
                            <div class="settings-control-heading">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Field of View</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        A wider view exposes more of the scene while making distant targets appear smaller.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="settings-value">
                                    <span class="settings-value-number">{{ fov }}</span>
                                    <span class="settings-value-unit">degrees</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-range-row">
                                <span class="settings-range-bound">{{ fov_minimum }}</span>
                                <input class="settings-range"
                                    type="range"
                                    min="10"
                                    max="150"
                                    step="1"
                                    value="100"
                                    data-attr-min="fov_minimum"
                                    data-attr-max="fov_maximum"
                                    data-attr-value="fov"
                                    onchange="settings.fov" />
                                <span class="settings-range-bound settings-range-maximum">{{ fov_maximum }}</span>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-control-footer">
                                <span class="settings-live-indicator"></span>
                                <span>Live value&nbsp;&nbsp;//&nbsp;&nbsp;Saved by the existing Sauer configuration system</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-info-row">
                            <div class="settings-info-block">
                                <div class="settings-info-label">Input</div>
                                <div class="settings-info-value">Mouse, arrows, or keyboard</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="settings-info-block">
                                <div class="settings-info-label">Range</div>
                                <div class="settings-info-value">{{ fov_minimum }} - {{ fov_maximum }} degrees</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="settings-info-block">
                                <div class="settings-info-label">Application</div>
                                <div class="settings-info-value">Immediate</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="settings-page" data-if="category_hud">
                        <div class="settings-stage-header">
                            <div class="eyebrow settings-eyebrow">HUD / Combat Feedback</div>
                            <div class="settings-stage-title">HUD</div>
                            <div class="settings-stage-copy">
                                Keep critical combat information readable without changing Cowbraten's existing HUD rendering behavior.
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section settings-compact-section panel">
                            <div class="settings-display-row">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Damage Screen</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Shows the existing red edge flash when damage is received.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <label class="checkbox-row settings-display-toggle">
                                    <input class="checkbox" type="checkbox"
                                        data-attrif-checked="damage_screen"
                                        onclick="settings.hud.damage-screen" />
                                    <span data-if="damage_screen">Enabled</span>
                                    <span data-if="!damage_screen">Disabled</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-display-row settings-control-divider">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Damage Compass</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Shows Sauer's directional damage wedges around the viewport.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <label class="checkbox-row settings-display-toggle">
                                    <input class="checkbox" type="checkbox"
                                        data-attrif-checked="damage_compass"
                                        onclick="settings.hud.damage-compass" />
                                    <span data-if="damage_compass">Enabled</span>
                                    <span data-if="!damage_compass">Disabled</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section settings-compact-section panel">
                            <div class="settings-display-row">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Frag &amp; Streak Messages</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Shows p1x frag messages and Cowbraten streak milestones using their existing shared HUD path.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <label class="checkbox-row settings-display-toggle">
                                    <input class="checkbox" type="checkbox"
                                        data-attrif-checked="frag_messages_enabled"
                                        onclick="settings.hud.frag-messages.enabled" />
                                    <span data-if="frag_messages_enabled">Enabled</span>
                                    <span data-if="!frag_messages_enabled">Disabled</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="settings-display-row settings-control-divider">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Show in Instagib</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        p1x provides one special exception for instagib; no equivalent per-mode switches exist for other modes.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <label class="checkbox-row settings-display-toggle">
                                    <input class="checkbox" type="checkbox"
                                        data-attrif-checked="frag_messages_in_insta"
                                        data-attrif-disabled="!frag_messages_enabled"
                                        onclick="settings.hud.frag-messages.insta" />
                                    <span data-if="frag_messages_in_insta">Shown</span>
                                    <span data-if="!frag_messages_in_insta">Hidden</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section settings-compact-section panel">
                            <div class="settings-display-row">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Streak Milestone Scale</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Additional size multiplier for Cowbraten's 5, 10, 15, 20, and 25 kill milestone messages.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="settings-stepper">
                                    <button class="button settings-stepper-button"
                                        onclick="settings.hud.streak-scale.decrease">-</button>
                                    <input class="text-input settings-stepper-value"
                                        type="text" maxlength="8"
                                        data-value="streak_milestone_scale_input"
                                        data-class-is-invalid="streak_milestone_scale_invalid"
                                        onfocus="settings.hud.streak-scale.focus"
                                        onblur="settings.hud.streak-scale.blur"
                                        onkeyup="settings.hud.streak-scale.commit" />
                                    <button class="button settings-stepper-button"
                                        onclick="settings.hud.streak-scale.increase">+</button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="settings-control-footer">
                                <span class="settings-live-indicator"></span>
                                <span>Range&nbsp;&nbsp;{{ streak_milestone_scale_minimum }} - {{ streak_milestone_scale_maximum }}&nbsp;&nbsp;//&nbsp;&nbsp;{{ hud_status }}</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="settings-page" data-if="category_graphics">
                        <div class="settings-stage-header">
                            <div class="eyebrow settings-eyebrow">System / Display</div>
                            <div class="settings-stage-title">Graphics</div>
                            <div class="settings-stage-copy">
                                Control the active window mode and choose a resolution supported by the current display.
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section settings-display-section panel">
                            <div class="settings-control-heading">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Presentation Mode</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Choose a resizable window, exclusive display mode, or borderless desktop fullscreen.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="settings-resolution-current settings-mode-current">
                                    <span class="settings-info-label">Actual mode</span>
                                    <span class="settings-resolution-current-value">{{ presentation_label }}</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-mode-selector">
                                <button class="button settings-mode-button"
                                    data-class-is-selected="presentation_windowed"
                                    onclick="settings.presentation.windowed">
                                    Windowed
                                </button>
                                <button class="button settings-mode-button"
                                    data-class-is-selected="presentation_exclusive"
                                    onclick="settings.presentation.exclusive">
                                    Exclusive
                                </button>
                                <button class="button settings-mode-button"
                                    data-class-is-selected="presentation_desktop"
                                    onclick="settings.presentation.desktop">
                                    Desktop / Borderless
                                </button>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-control-footer">
                                <span class="settings-live-indicator"></span>
                                <span>{{ video_status }}</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section settings-performance-section panel">
                            <div class="settings-display-row">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Vertical Synchronization</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Synchronize presentation with the display. Driver acceptance is read back from SDL.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <label class="checkbox-row settings-display-toggle">
                                    <input class="checkbox"
                                        type="checkbox"
                                        data-attrif-checked="vsync"
                                        onclick="settings.vsync" />
                                    <span data-if="vsync_adaptive">Adaptive</span>
                                    <span data-if="vsync &amp;&amp; !vsync_adaptive">Enabled</span>
                                    <span data-if="!vsync">Disabled</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-control-footer settings-control-footer-compact">
                                <span class="settings-live-indicator"></span>
                                <span>{{ vsync_status }}</span>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-control-heading settings-fps-heading">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Frame Rate Limit</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Cap rendered frames without reducing Cowbraten's input or network processing frequency. Zero is unlimited.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="settings-value settings-fps-value">
                                    <span class="settings-fps-value-label">{{ fps_limit_label }}</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-range-row settings-fps-range-row">
                                <span class="settings-range-bound">0</span>
                                <input class="settings-range"
                                    type="range"
                                    min="0"
                                    max="1000"
                                    step="1"
                                    value="200"
                                    data-attr-min="fps_limit_minimum"
                                    data-attr-max="fps_limit_maximum"
                                    data-attr-value="fps_limit"
                                    onchange="settings.fps-limit" />
                                <span class="settings-range-bound settings-range-maximum">1000</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section settings-antialiasing-section panel">
                            <div class="settings-control-heading">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Antialiasing</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Multisample the scene edges. Changing this option rebuilds the existing OpenGL context.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="settings-resolution-current settings-antialiasing-current">
                                    <span class="settings-info-label">Actual runtime</span>
                                    <span class="settings-resolution-current-value">{{ antialiasing_label }}</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-antialiasing-selector">
                                <button class="button settings-antialiasing-button"
                                    data-class-is-selected="antialiasing_off"
                                    data-event-click="select_antialiasing(0)">Off</button>
                                <button class="button settings-antialiasing-button"
                                    data-class-is-selected="antialiasing_2x"
                                    data-event-click="select_antialiasing(2)">2x</button>
                                <button class="button settings-antialiasing-button"
                                    data-class-is-selected="antialiasing_4x"
                                    data-event-click="select_antialiasing(4)">4x</button>
                                <button class="button settings-antialiasing-button"
                                    data-class-is-selected="antialiasing_8x"
                                    data-event-click="select_antialiasing(8)">8x</button>
                                <button class="button settings-antialiasing-button"
                                    data-class-is-selected="antialiasing_16x"
                                    data-event-click="select_antialiasing(16)">16x</button>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-control-footer">
                                <span class="settings-live-indicator"></span>
                                <span>{{ antialiasing_status }}</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section settings-resolution-section panel">
                            <div class="settings-control-heading">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Resolution</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Available modes are reported by SDL for the display containing the game window.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="settings-resolution-current">
                                    <span class="settings-info-label">Current</span>
                                    <span class="settings-resolution-current-value">{{ resolution_label }}</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-resolution-grid">
                                <div class="settings-resolution-repeat"
                                    data-for="resolution : resolutions">
                                    <button class="button settings-resolution-button"
                                        data-class-is-selected="resolution.selected"
                                        data-attrif-disabled="!resolution_enabled || !resolution.supported"
                                        data-event-click="select_resolution(resolution.width, resolution.height)">
                                        {{ resolution.label }}
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-resolution-note" data-if="presentation_desktop">
                                Desktop fullscreen uses the display's native size. Resolution selection is unavailable in this mode.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="settings-page" data-if="category_audio">
                        <div class="settings-stage-header">
                            <div class="eyebrow settings-eyebrow">Audio / Mix</div>
                            <div class="settings-stage-title">Audio</div>
                            <div class="settings-stage-copy">
                                Balance gameplay sounds and music through Cowbraten's existing SDL_mixer audio path.
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section settings-audio-section panel">
                            <div class="settings-control-heading">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Sound Volume</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Controls gameplay sound effects. Setting this to zero also mutes music through Sauer's existing global audio gate.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="settings-value settings-audio-value">
                                    <span class="settings-fps-value-label">{{ sound_volume_label }}</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-range-row settings-audio-range-row">
                                <span class="settings-range-bound">{{ sound_volume_minimum }}</span>
                                <input class="settings-range"
                                    type="range"
                                    min="0"
                                    max="255"
                                    step="1"
                                    value="255"
                                    data-attr-min="sound_volume_minimum"
                                    data-attr-max="sound_volume_maximum"
                                    data-attr-value="sound_volume"
                                    onchange="settings.audio.sound-volume" />
                                <span class="settings-range-bound settings-range-maximum">{{ sound_volume_maximum }}</span>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-control-footer">
                                <span class="settings-live-indicator"></span>
                                <span>Engine value&nbsp;&nbsp;{{ sound_volume }} / {{ sound_volume_maximum }}</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section settings-audio-section panel">
                            <div class="settings-control-heading">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Music Volume</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Controls streamed music independently while Sound Volume remains above zero.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="settings-value settings-audio-value">
                                    <span class="settings-fps-value-label">{{ music_volume_label }}</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-range-row settings-audio-range-row">
                                <span class="settings-range-bound">{{ music_volume_minimum }}</span>
                                <input class="settings-range"
                                    type="range"
                                    min="0"
                                    max="255"
                                    step="1"
                                    value="128"
                                    data-attr-min="music_volume_minimum"
                                    data-attr-max="music_volume_maximum"
                                    data-attr-value="music_volume"
                                    onchange="settings.audio.music-volume" />
                                <span class="settings-range-bound settings-range-maximum">{{ music_volume_maximum }}</span>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-control-footer">
                                <span class="settings-live-indicator"></span>
                                <span>Engine value&nbsp;&nbsp;{{ music_volume }} / {{ music_volume_maximum }}</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section settings-audio-section panel">
                            <div class="settings-control-heading">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Soundpack</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Selects an installed gameplay sound pack discovered through the active Sauer package roots.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="settings-value settings-soundpack-current">
                                    <span class="settings-soundpack-current-label">{{ active_soundpack_label }}</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-soundpack-grid">
                                <div class="settings-soundpack-repeat"
                                    data-for="pack : soundpack_choices">
                                    <button class="button settings-soundpack-choice"
                                        data-class-is-selected="pack.selected"
                                        data-event-click="select_soundpack(pack.id)">
                                        <span class="settings-soundpack-choice-label">{{ pack.label }}</span>
                                        <span class="settings-soundpack-choice-state"
                                            data-if="pack.selected">Active</span>
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-control-footer">
                                <span class="settings-live-indicator"></span>
                                <span>{{ soundpack_status }}</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-info-row settings-audio-info-row">
                            <div class="settings-info-block">
                                <div class="settings-info-label">Runtime</div>
                                <div class="settings-info-value">{{ audio_status }}</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="settings-info-block">
                                <div class="settings-info-label">Application</div>
                                <div class="settings-info-value">Immediate</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="settings-info-block">
                                <div class="settings-info-label">Persistence</div>
                                <div class="settings-info-value">Existing Sauer config</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="settings-page" data-if="category_mouse_keyboard">
                        <div class="settings-stage-header">
                            <div class="eyebrow settings-eyebrow">Input / Gameplay</div>
                            <div class="settings-stage-title">Mouse &amp; Keyboard</div>
                            <div class="settings-stage-copy">
                                Adjust the existing gameplay mouse response. Key binding capture remains intentionally separate.
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section settings-input-section panel">
                            <div class="settings-control-heading">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Mouse Sensitivity</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Changes the relative mouse scale used for camera movement. Buttons adjust by 0.01; type an exact value and press Enter.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="settings-stepper">
                                    <button class="button settings-stepper-button"
                                        onclick="settings.input.sensitivity.decrease">-</button>
                                    <input class="text-input settings-stepper-value"
                                        type="text"
                                        maxlength="16"
                                        data-value="mouse_sensitivity_input"
                                        data-class-is-invalid="mouse_sensitivity_invalid"
                                        onfocus="settings.input.sensitivity.focus"
                                        onblur="settings.input.sensitivity.blur"
                                        onkeyup="settings.input.sensitivity.commit" />
                                    <button class="button settings-stepper-button"
                                        onclick="settings.input.sensitivity.increase">+</button>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-control-footer">
                                <span class="settings-live-indicator"></span>
                                <span data-if="mouse_sensitivity_status != ''">{{ mouse_sensitivity_status }}&nbsp;&nbsp;//&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>
                                <span>Engine range&nbsp;&nbsp;{{ mouse_sensitivity_minimum }} - {{ mouse_sensitivity_maximum }}</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section settings-input-section panel">
                            <div class="settings-display-row">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Invert Vertical Look</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Reverses vertical camera movement while preserving horizontal look.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <label class="checkbox-row settings-display-toggle">
                                    <input class="checkbox"
                                        type="checkbox"
                                        data-attrif-checked="inverted_mouse"
                                        onclick="settings.input.inverted-mouse" />
                                    <span data-if="inverted_mouse">Inverted</span>
                                    <span data-if="!inverted_mouse">Standard</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-control-footer">
                                <span class="settings-live-indicator"></span>
                                <span>{{ mouse_input_status }}</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section settings-keybindings-panel panel">
                            <div class="settings-control-title">Key Bindings</div>
                            <div class="settings-control-description">
                                Capture a key, then Apply or Replace to assign it. Replace changes only that key; other keys are preserved.
                            </div>
                            <div class="settings-key-result" data-if="key_binding_status != ''">{{ key_binding_status }}</div>

                            <div class="settings-keybinding-group">
                                <div class="settings-keybinding-group-title">Movement</div>
                                <div class="settings-keybinding-list">
                                    <div class="settings-keybinding-row"
                                        data-for="binding : keybindings_movement">
                                        <span class="settings-keybinding-label">{{ binding.label }}</span>
                                        <div class="settings-keybinding-values">
                                            <span class="settings-key-chip"
                                                data-for="key : binding.keys">
                                                <span>{{ key }}</span>
                                                <button class="button settings-key-remove"
                                                    title="Remove binding"
                                                    data-event-click="request_key_removal(binding.action_id, key)">×</button>
                                            </span>
                                            <span class="settings-key-unbound"
                                                data-if="!binding.bound">Unbound</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <button class="button settings-key-rebind"
                                            data-event-click="capture_key(binding.action_id)">Rebind</button>
                                        <div class="settings-key-removal"
                                            data-if="key_removal_active && key_removal_action_id == binding.action_id">
                                            <div>{{ key_removal_prompt }}</div>
                                            <div class="settings-key-decisions">
                                                <button class="button" data-event-click="decide_key_removal(1)">Remove</button>
                                                <button class="button" data-event-click="decide_key_removal(0)">Cancel</button>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <span class="settings-key-capture"
                                            data-if="key_capture_id == binding.action_id">{{ key_capture_status }}</span>
                                        <span class="settings-key-conflict"
                                            data-if="key_capture_id == binding.action_id && key_conflict_status != ''"
                                            data-class-is-available="key_conflict_available"
                                            data-class-is-same-action="key_conflict_same_action"
                                            data-class-is-conflict="key_conflict_present">{{ key_conflict_status }}</span>
                                        <div class="settings-key-decisions"
                                            data-if="key_capture_id == binding.action_id && key_candidate_pending">
                                            <button class="button" data-if="key_conflict_available"
                                                data-event-click="decide_key(binding.action_id, 1)">Apply</button>
                                            <button class="button" data-if="key_conflict_present"
                                                data-event-click="decide_key(binding.action_id, 2)">Replace</button>
                                            <button class="button"
                                                data-event-click="decide_key(binding.action_id, 0)">{{ key_conflict_same_action ? 'Dismiss' : 'Cancel' }}</button>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-keybinding-group">
                                <div class="settings-keybinding-group-title">Combat</div>
                                <div class="settings-keybinding-list">
                                    <div class="settings-keybinding-row"
                                        data-for="binding : keybindings_combat">
                                        <span class="settings-keybinding-label">{{ binding.label }}</span>
                                        <div class="settings-keybinding-values">
                                            <span class="settings-key-chip"
                                                data-for="key : binding.keys">
                                                <span>{{ key }}</span>
                                                <button class="button settings-key-remove"
                                                    title="Remove binding"
                                                    data-event-click="request_key_removal(binding.action_id, key)">×</button>
                                            </span>
                                            <span class="settings-key-unbound"
                                                data-if="!binding.bound">Unbound</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <button class="button settings-key-rebind"
                                            data-event-click="capture_key(binding.action_id)">Rebind</button>
                                        <div class="settings-key-removal"
                                            data-if="key_removal_active && key_removal_action_id == binding.action_id">
                                            <div>{{ key_removal_prompt }}</div>
                                            <div class="settings-key-decisions">
                                                <button class="button" data-event-click="decide_key_removal(1)">Remove</button>
                                                <button class="button" data-event-click="decide_key_removal(0)">Cancel</button>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <span class="settings-key-capture"
                                            data-if="key_capture_id == binding.action_id">{{ key_capture_status }}</span>
                                        <span class="settings-key-conflict"
                                            data-if="key_capture_id == binding.action_id && key_conflict_status != ''"
                                            data-class-is-available="key_conflict_available"
                                            data-class-is-same-action="key_conflict_same_action"
                                            data-class-is-conflict="key_conflict_present">{{ key_conflict_status }}</span>
                                        <div class="settings-key-decisions"
                                            data-if="key_capture_id == binding.action_id && key_candidate_pending">
                                            <button class="button" data-if="key_conflict_available"
                                                data-event-click="decide_key(binding.action_id, 1)">Apply</button>
                                            <button class="button" data-if="key_conflict_present"
                                                data-event-click="decide_key(binding.action_id, 2)">Replace</button>
                                            <button class="button"
                                                data-event-click="decide_key(binding.action_id, 0)">{{ key_conflict_same_action ? 'Dismiss' : 'Cancel' }}</button>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="settings-keybinding-group">
                                <div class="settings-keybinding-group-title">Interface</div>
                                <div class="settings-keybinding-list">
                                    <div class="settings-keybinding-row"
                                        data-for="binding : keybindings_interface">
                                        <span class="settings-keybinding-label">{{ binding.label }}</span>
                                        <div class="settings-keybinding-values">
                                            <span class="settings-key-chip"
                                                data-for="key : binding.keys">
                                                <span>{{ key }}</span>
                                                <button class="button settings-key-remove"
                                                    title="Remove binding"
                                                    data-event-click="request_key_removal(binding.action_id, key)">×</button>
                                            </span>
                                            <span class="settings-key-unbound"
                                                data-if="!binding.bound">Unbound</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <button class="button settings-key-rebind"
                                            data-event-click="capture_key(binding.action_id)">Rebind</button>
                                        <div class="settings-key-removal"
                                            data-if="key_removal_active && key_removal_action_id == binding.action_id">
                                            <div>{{ key_removal_prompt }}</div>
                                            <div class="settings-key-decisions">
                                                <button class="button" data-event-click="decide_key_removal(1)">Remove</button>
                                                <button class="button" data-event-click="decide_key_removal(0)">Cancel</button>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <span class="settings-key-capture"
                                            data-if="key_capture_id == binding.action_id">{{ key_capture_status }}</span>
                                        <span class="settings-key-conflict"
                                            data-if="key_capture_id == binding.action_id && key_conflict_status != ''"
                                            data-class-is-available="key_conflict_available"
                                            data-class-is-same-action="key_conflict_same_action"
                                            data-class-is-conflict="key_conflict_present">{{ key_conflict_status }}</span>
                                        <div class="settings-key-decisions"
                                            data-if="key_capture_id == binding.action_id && key_candidate_pending">
                                            <button class="button" data-if="key_conflict_available"
                                                data-event-click="decide_key(binding.action_id, 1)">Apply</button>
                                            <button class="button" data-if="key_conflict_present"
                                                data-event-click="decide_key(binding.action_id, 2)">Replace</button>
                                            <button class="button"
                                                data-event-click="decide_key(binding.action_id, 0)">{{ key_conflict_same_action ? 'Dismiss' : 'Cancel' }}</button>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="settings-page" data-if="category_crosshair">
                        <div class="settings-stage-header">
                            <div class="eyebrow settings-eyebrow">HUD / Reticle</div>
                            <div class="settings-stage-title">Crosshair</div>
                            <div class="settings-stage-copy">
                                Select the existing Sauer crosshair pair and configure the gameplay-owned dynamic states.
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section settings-compact-section panel">
                            <div class="settings-control-heading">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Crosshair Style</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Choosing a style loads its normal and hit textures through Sauer's texture manager.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="settings-value settings-crosshair-current">
                                    <img class="settings-crosshair-current-image"
                                        data-attr-src="crosshair_selection_resource" />
                                    <span class="settings-crosshair-current-label">{{ crosshair_selection_label }}</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="settings-crosshair-grid">
                                <div class="settings-crosshair-repeat"
                                    data-for="choice : crosshair_choices">
                                    <button class="button settings-crosshair-choice"
                                        data-class-is-selected="choice.selected"
                                        data-event-click="select_crosshair(choice.id)">
                                        <img class="settings-crosshair-choice-image"
                                            data-attr-src="choice.resource" />
                                        <span class="settings-crosshair-choice-label">{{ choice.label }}</span>
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section settings-compact-section panel">
                            <div class="settings-display-row">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Crosshair Size</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Uses Sauer's exact integer size. Buttons move by one; type a value to commit on Enter or focus loss.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="settings-stepper">
                                    <button class="button settings-stepper-button"
                                        onclick="settings.crosshair.size.decrease">-</button>
                                    <input class="text-input settings-stepper-value"
                                        type="text" maxlength="3"
                                        data-value="crosshair_size_input"
                                        data-class-is-invalid="crosshair_size_invalid"
                                        onfocus="settings.crosshair.size.focus"
                                        onblur="settings.crosshair.size.blur"
                                        onkeyup="settings.crosshair.size.commit" />
                                    <button class="button settings-stepper-button"
                                        onclick="settings.crosshair.size.increase">+</button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="settings-control-footer">
                                <span class="settings-live-indicator"></span>
                                <span>Range&nbsp;&nbsp;{{ crosshair_size_minimum }} - {{ crosshair_size_maximum }}&nbsp;&nbsp;//&nbsp;&nbsp;{{ crosshair_status }}</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section settings-compact-section panel">
                            <div class="settings-display-row">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Dynamic Effects</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Master switch for teammate, hit, and health-color crosshair states.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <label class="checkbox-row settings-display-toggle">
                                    <input class="checkbox" type="checkbox"
                                        data-attrif-checked="crosshair_effects"
                                        onclick="settings.crosshair.effects" />
                                    <span data-if="crosshair_effects">Enabled</span>
                                    <span data-if="!crosshair_effects">Disabled</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="settings-display-row settings-control-divider">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Health Colors</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Uses inherited low-health crosshair colors outside instagib modes.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <label class="checkbox-row settings-display-toggle">
                                    <input class="checkbox" type="checkbox"
                                        data-attrif-checked="crosshair_health_colors"
                                        data-attrif-disabled="!crosshair_effects"
                                        onclick="settings.crosshair.health-colors" />
                                    <span data-if="crosshair_health_colors">Enabled</span>
                                    <span data-if="!crosshair_health_colors">Disabled</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="settings-display-row settings-control-divider">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Teammate Crosshair</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Switches to the teammate state when aiming at an ally.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <label class="checkbox-row settings-display-toggle">
                                    <input class="checkbox" type="checkbox"
                                        data-attrif-checked="team_crosshair"
                                        data-attrif-disabled="!crosshair_effects"
                                        onclick="settings.crosshair.teammates" />
                                    <span data-if="team_crosshair">Enabled</span>
                                    <span data-if="!team_crosshair">Disabled</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="settings-display-row settings-control-divider">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Hit Marker</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Shows the selected hit texture for Sauer's standard 425 ms interval.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <label class="checkbox-row settings-display-toggle">
                                    <input class="checkbox" type="checkbox"
                                        data-attrif-checked="hit_crosshair"
                                        data-attrif-disabled="!crosshair_effects"
                                        onclick="settings.crosshair.hit-marker" />
                                    <span data-if="hit_crosshair">Enabled</span>
                                    <span data-if="!hit_crosshair">Disabled</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section settings-compact-section panel">
                            <div class="settings-display-row">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Reload Fade</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        p1x rifle reload feedback fades from red to the ready color in instagib.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <label class="checkbox-row settings-display-toggle">
                                    <input class="checkbox" type="checkbox"
                                        data-attrif-checked="crosshair_reload_fade"
                                        data-attrif-disabled="!crosshair_effects || !crosshair_health_colors"
                                        onclick="settings.crosshair.reload-fade" />
                                    <span data-if="crosshair_reload_fade">Enabled</span>
                                    <span data-if="!crosshair_reload_fade">Disabled</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="settings-display-row settings-control-divider">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Reload Rotation</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Cowbraten rotates the rifle crosshair from 45 degrees back to ready during reload.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <label class="checkbox-row settings-display-toggle">
                                    <input class="checkbox" type="checkbox"
                                        data-attrif-checked="crosshair_reload_rotation"
                                        onclick="settings.crosshair.reload-rotation" />
                                    <span data-if="crosshair_reload_rotation">Enabled</span>
                                    <span data-if="!crosshair_reload_rotation">Disabled</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div>

                    <div class="settings-page" data-if="category_chat">
                        <div class="settings-stage-header">
                            <div class="eyebrow settings-eyebrow">Game / Communications</div>
                            <div class="settings-stage-title">Chat</div>
                            <div class="settings-stage-copy">
                                Control where public and team messages appear without changing message delivery, input, or the full console history.
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section settings-compact-section panel">
                            <div class="settings-control-title">Top-left Feed</div>
                            <div class="settings-control-description">
                                The normal in-game console feed. Hidden messages remain available in the full console.
                            </div>
                            <div class="settings-display-row settings-control-divider">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Public Messages</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Show normal player chat in the top-left feed.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <label class="checkbox-row settings-display-toggle">
                                    <input class="checkbox" type="checkbox"
                                        data-attrif-checked="public_chat_in_top_feed"
                                        onclick="settings.chat.top.public" />
                                    <span data-if="public_chat_in_top_feed">Shown</span>
                                    <span data-if="!public_chat_in_top_feed">Hidden</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="settings-display-row settings-control-divider">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Team Messages</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Show team and spectator-team chat in the top-left feed.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <label class="checkbox-row settings-display-toggle">
                                    <input class="checkbox" type="checkbox"
                                        data-attrif-checked="team_chat_in_top_feed"
                                        onclick="settings.chat.top.team" />
                                    <span data-if="team_chat_in_top_feed">Shown</span>
                                    <span data-if="!team_chat_in_top_feed">Hidden</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section settings-compact-section panel">
                            <div class="settings-control-title">Bottom-left Chat Box</div>
                            <div class="settings-control-description">
                                Sauer's compact lower message feed. Public and team message types can be routed independently.
                            </div>
                            <div class="settings-display-row settings-control-divider">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Public Messages</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Mirror normal player chat in the bottom-left box.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <label class="checkbox-row settings-display-toggle">
                                    <input class="checkbox" type="checkbox"
                                        data-attrif-checked="public_chat_in_bottom_box"
                                        onclick="settings.chat.bottom.public" />
                                    <span data-if="public_chat_in_bottom_box">Shown</span>
                                    <span data-if="!public_chat_in_bottom_box">Hidden</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="settings-display-row settings-control-divider">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Team Messages</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Mirror team and spectator-team chat in the bottom-left box.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <label class="checkbox-row settings-display-toggle">
                                    <input class="checkbox" type="checkbox"
                                        data-attrif-checked="team_chat_in_bottom_box"
                                        onclick="settings.chat.bottom.team" />
                                    <span data-if="team_chat_in_bottom_box">Shown</span>
                                    <span data-if="!team_chat_in_bottom_box">Hidden</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section settings-compact-section panel">
                            <div class="settings-display-row">
                                <div class="settings-control-copy">
                                    <div class="settings-control-title">Team-colored Names</div>
                                    <div class="settings-control-description">
                                        Use each player's team color for their name in public and team chat.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <label class="checkbox-row settings-display-toggle">
                                    <input class="checkbox" type="checkbox"
                                        data-attrif-checked="team_colored_chat_names"
                                        onclick="settings.chat.team-colors" />
                                    <span data-if="team_colored_chat_names">Enabled</span>
                                    <span data-if="!team_colored_chat_names">Disabled</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-info-row">
                            <div class="settings-info-block">
                                <div class="settings-info-label">Application</div>
                                <div class="settings-info-value">Immediate</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="settings-info-block">
                                <div class="settings-info-label">Full Console</div>
                                <div class="settings-info-value">Filter unchanged</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="settings-info-block">
                                <div class="settings-info-label">Persistence</div>
                                <div class="settings-info-value">Existing Sauer config</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="settings-footer">
                <div>
                    <span data-if="category_game">Settings&nbsp;&nbsp;//&nbsp;&nbsp;Game</span>
                    <span data-if="category_hud">Settings&nbsp;&nbsp;//&nbsp;&nbsp;HUD</span>
                    <span data-if="category_graphics">Settings&nbsp;&nbsp;//&nbsp;&nbsp;Graphics</span>
                    <span data-if="category_audio">Settings&nbsp;&nbsp;//&nbsp;&nbsp;Audio</span>
                    <span data-if="category_mouse_keyboard">Settings&nbsp;&nbsp;//&nbsp;&nbsp;Mouse / Keyboard</span>
                    <span data-if="category_crosshair">Settings&nbsp;&nbsp;//&nbsp;&nbsp;Crosshair</span>
                    <span data-if="category_chat">Settings&nbsp;&nbsp;//&nbsp;&nbsp;Chat</span>
                </div>
                <div class="settings-footer-help">Escape returns to gameplay</div>
                <div class="settings-footer-status">
                    <span class="settings-live-indicator"></span>
                    <span>Engine connected</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
